@nsobid-6C4BC35D955FABDEF98616FA93F38FAF49B5FE48

# Clubhouse Games 51 Worldwide Classics 2.0.1 - 4096x4096 shadow resolution

@flag print_values
@flag offset_shift 0x100

// Forces the cascaded shadow map to 4096x4096 (stock default 1024x1024).
//
// The engine shadow system allocates a four-cascade D16 texture array sized by
// its current shadow map size and recreates it whenever that size changes, so
// scripts can resize it at runtime. Every consumer reads the size through
// one getter (sub_710068F5E4: allocation, per-frame resize check and the
// shadow draw) or directly when setting the cascade viewports
// (sub_7100753FF0). Both reads become the fixed size, so the texture, the
// viewports and the shader texel size stay in agreement.
//
// REQUIRES one of the [WxH] resolution mods. The maps come from GPU memory
// pool 4 and grow it by about 120 MB, which the stock 128 MB pool cannot
// absorb. The resolution mods own that pool and already size it for this mod;
// do NOT copy their offsets here.

@enabled
0068F5FC 00008252   // MOVZ W0,#4096  (was LDR W0,[X8,X9] = current shadow map size)
0075403C 15008252   // MOVZ W21,#4096 (was LDR W21,[X20,X8], cascade viewport size)
@stop

// Offsets reverse-engineered against Clubhouse Games 51 Worldwide Classics
// 2.0.1 (NdCube Bezel engine + nd::NdRender, NVN). The retail build keeps only
// a partial symbol table; every site was located by structure and
// byte-verified against the IDB before being written.
//
// https://github.com/RAMDRAGONS/switch-patches
